## Setup Instructions

### 1. Clone the repository
```bash
git clone <repo-url>
cd CGIP
```

### 2. Create a virtual environment
```bash
python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate        # macOS/Linux
venv\Scripts\activate           # Windows
```

### 3. Install dependencies
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### 4. Run the baseline pipeline test
```bash
python src/main.py
```

Expected output: A window titled **"Pipeline Test"** displaying the Canny edge output with the text `CG & IP Pipeline OK`.

