## Git Branch Strategy

- `main` — protected, stable code only
- `feature/ui-setup` — GUI development
- `feature/image-loader` — image acquisition & preprocessing
- `feature/face-detection` — face detection module
- `feature/recognition` — feature extraction & recognition
- `feature/database` — attendance logging & reporting
